sequenceDiagram
    participant DSP as Data Science Pipelines<br/>(DSP Controller)
    participant KFP as Kubeflow Pipelines SDK<br/>(Pipeline Step)
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC Server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC/HTTP2
    participant DB as MySQL/PostgreSQL<br/>3306/5432 TCP
    participant UI as Pipeline UI<br/>(Dashboard)

    Note over DSP,DB: Flow 1: Pipeline Metadata Recording

    DSP->>MLMD: PutExecutionType<br/>gRPC | Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT execution_type<br/>MySQL/PG protocol | Optional TLS
    DB-->>MLMD: Type ID
    MLMD-->>DSP: PutExecutionTypeResponse

    KFP->>MLMD: PutExecution<br/>(execution + artifacts + events + contexts)<br/>gRPC | Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION<br/>INSERT execution, artifacts, events<br/>MySQL/PG protocol | Optional TLS
    DB-->>MLMD: IDs
    MLMD-->>KFP: PutExecutionResponse

    KFP->>MLMD: PutArtifacts<br/>(output datasets, models, metrics)<br/>gRPC | Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE artifacts<br/>MySQL/PG protocol | Optional TLS
    DB-->>MLMD: Artifact IDs
    MLMD-->>KFP: PutArtifactsResponse

    KFP->>MLMD: PutContexts + PutAttributionsAndAssociations<br/>gRPC | Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT contexts, attributions, associations<br/>MySQL/PG protocol | Optional TLS
    DB-->>MLMD: Context IDs
    MLMD-->>KFP: Response

    Note over UI,DB: Flow 2: Lineage Query

    UI->>MLMD: GetLineageSubgraph<br/>(starting_nodes, max_num_hops, direction)<br/>gRPC | Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: SELECT artifacts, executions, events<br/>(graph traversal queries)<br/>MySQL/PG protocol | Optional TLS
    DB-->>MLMD: Lineage graph rows
    MLMD-->>UI: LineageSubgraphResponse<br/>(artifacts, executions, contexts, events)

    UI->>MLMD: GetArtifactsByID<br/>gRPC | Optional TLS/mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: SELECT * FROM artifacts WHERE id IN (...)<br/>MySQL/PG protocol | Optional TLS
    DB-->>MLMD: Artifact details
    MLMD-->>UI: GetArtifactsResponse
